### ============================================================================
### Bee Academy - Media & Cloudinary Storage Scenarios
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Đăng nhập Giáo viên lấy Token
# @name teacherLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@beeacademy.edu.vn",
  "password": "Password123@"
}

### Lưu Token giáo viên
@teacherToken = {{teacherLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2. Lấy chữ ký số Signed Upload (Dành cho Frontend upload trực tiếp lên Cloudinary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/signature?folder=beeacademy/courses/videos&resourceType=video
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### 3. Upload ảnh Thumbnail khóa học qua Backend API
POST {{baseUrl}}/media/upload/image
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_thumbnail.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4. Upload video bài giảng qua Backend API (Tự động trích xuất durationSec)
POST {{baseUrl}}/media/upload/video
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="lesson_sample.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample.mp4
--WebAppBoundary--
